{
  "start": "-PT12H",
  "periodOverride": "inherit",
  "widgets": [
    {
      "type": "metric",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 12,
      "height": 6,
      "properties": {
        "title": "Infrastructure: champion CPU and memory (CPU is per-core sum)",
        "region": "us-east-1",
        "period": 300,
        "stat": "Average",
        "view": "timeSeries",
        "metrics": [
          [
            "/aws/sagemaker/Endpoints",
            "CPUUtilization",
            "EndpointName",
            "northstar-churn-prod",
            "VariantName",
            "champion"
          ],
          [
            "/aws/sagemaker/Endpoints",
            "MemoryUtilization",
            "EndpointName",
            "northstar-churn-prod",
            "VariantName",
            "champion"
          ]
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "metric",
      "x": 12,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 12,
      "height": 6,
      "properties": {
        "title": "Application: champion latency p50/p95/p99 (microseconds)",
        "region": "us-east-1",
        "period": 300,
        "stat": "Average",
        "view": "timeSeries",
        "metrics": [
          [
            "AWS/SageMaker",
            "ModelLatency",
            "EndpointName",
            "northstar-churn-prod",
            "VariantName",
            "champion",
            {
              "stat": "p50"
            }
          ],
          [
            "AWS/SageMaker",
            "ModelLatency",
            "EndpointName",
            "northstar-churn-prod",
            "VariantName",
            "champion",
            {
              "stat": "p95"
            }
          ],
          [
            "AWS/SageMaker",
            "ModelLatency",
            "EndpointName",
            "northstar-churn-prod",
            "VariantName",
            "champion",
            {
              "stat": "p99"
            }
          ]
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "metric",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 6,
      "width": 12,
      "height": 6,
      "properties": {
        "title": "Model: top-three feature PSI and drift status",
        "region": "us-east-1",
        "period": 300,
        "stat": "Maximum",
        "view": "timeSeries",
        "metrics": [
          [
            "NorthStar/ChurnModel",
            "PSI_days_since_last_purchase",
            "EndpointName",
            "northstar-churn-prod"
          ],
          [
            "NorthStar/ChurnModel",
            "PSI_purchase_frequency_180d",
            "EndpointName",
            "northstar-churn-prod"
          ],
          [
            "NorthStar/ChurnModel",
            "PSI_purchase_frequency_30d",
            "EndpointName",
            "northstar-churn-prod"
          ],
          [
            "NorthStar/ChurnModel",
            "DriftDetected",
            "EndpointName",
            "northstar-churn-prod"
          ],
          [
            "NorthStar/ChurnModel",
            "DriftViolationCount",
            "EndpointName",
            "northstar-churn-prod"
          ]
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "metric",
      "x": 12,
      "y": 6,
      "width": 12,
      "height": 6,
      "properties": {
        "title": "Pipeline: actual Glue terminal-state events",
        "region": "us-east-1",
        "period": 300,
        "stat": "Sum",
        "view": "timeSeries",
        "metrics": [
          [
            "NorthStar/Pipeline",
            "JobSucceeded"
          ],
          [
            "NorthStar/Pipeline",
            "JobFailed"
          ]
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "metric",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 12,
      "width": 12,
      "height": 6,
      "properties": {
        "title": "Business: churn-alert volume proxy (daily snapshot)",
        "region": "us-east-1",
        "period": 86400,
        "stat": "Maximum",
        "view": "timeSeries",
        "metrics": [
          [
            "NorthStar/ChurnModel",
            "ChurnAlertVolume",
            "EndpointName",
            "northstar-churn-prod"
          ],
          [
            "NorthStar/ChurnModel",
            "ChurnAlertVolume7DayAverage",
            "EndpointName",
            "northstar-churn-prod"
          ]
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "x": 12,
      "y": 12,
      "width": 12,
      "height": 6,
      "properties": {
        "markdown": "### Lab 6 observation notes\nChampion is monitored because it carries 90% of traffic. The comparison uses distinct single-row requests from a reproducible sample of Lab 2 customers; it demonstrates the monitoring path, not current-world drift.\n\nBusiness volume counts sampled customers with score >=0.5. No seven-day history is fabricated. The volume-drop alarm remains INSUFFICIENT_DATA until seven real daily snapshots exist.\n\nTask 1 creates observable alarms with actions disabled. Task 3 will define severity, escalation, and suppression."
      }
    }
  ]
}
